{align:justify|PHOENIX DRESSING LADY}

{align:justify|This is an article by Layman Triet Ngo, a member who remembered and talked about his past life, leaving readers shocked.}
{align:justify|The author has an extremely good memory, can remember even the time when he was in diapers, and also remembers how he fell into hell in his last life and suffered his sins. Before falling into hell, the author was a girl with a charming appearance. Due to being deceived about her love and money, she hanged herself. Because he died with strong anger, he immediately fell into hell and suffered a lot.}
{align:justify|Now, please listen to the author:}
{align:justify|“When I was a child, I had a very good memory. From the time I was in the cradle, I knew and remembered everything that happened: For example, when I was lying in my crib, I saw my mother had asthma and my father gave her an injection... Then when I learned to walk, I was chased by geese... To this day, everyone remembers it very clearly. At times, some very strange images appeared in my brain, which were the scene of a young girl falling into hell. Sometimes when I tell my parents these things, they always laugh and lovingly say that it's because I'm young that I'm not thinking nonsense!}
{align:justify|My family follows paganism, worships Gods, not Buddha. When I was six years old, my grandmother took me to the Than Altar (the altar to worship the gods) for me to participate in a ritual called "The Ceremony of Opening the Heavenly Eye": I drank wine soaked in the blood on my hands, wrote a spell, and then burned it. From that moment, the door connecting my past life memories was opened, allowing me to see through my past life, every scene and image was very clear!}
{align:justify|It turns out that in my previous life, I was a prostitute, wearing a graceful Phoenix dress, and loved watching "songs and operas"(7) but I don't know which era it belonged to.}
{align:justify|Due to a difficult family background when I was young, I had to work as a cook for a rich man. Because of my beauty, the boss was raped by lust. After that, I went to work as a courtesan. The owner and his wife love the castle very much and are extremely kind to me.}
{align:justify|At that time, I was a young, charming beauty queen, so I took advantage of my beauty to cheat on love, money... of so many people, in the end I was deceived by another guy, causing me to lose all my money and love. I was extremely angry, always wanted revenge and could not bear the pain, so I hanged myself.}
{align:justify|I saw that my body was dead, but the soul went to a big place with a blazing fire, there were men, women, old people, children... Everyone's face was gloomy and sad, it seemed like we were all walking on a predetermined path, radiating a strong, invisible gravitational force that made everyone rush straight into it.}
{align:justify|After walking for a while, we came across a cheap path, everyone scattered, me and a group of people went to the place where there is a wooden bridge across the abyss, often called Nai Ha bridge, in here it was dark and cold, there were screams, screams, cries, cries... The sound rang out, each stream of foul steam filled with blood rushed into my nose. Many people fell from the wet, dark, and slippery bridge.}
{align:justify|I didn't want to continue, but I had no right to decide, so I just walked onto the bridge. Not long after walking, my foot slipped and I fell down.}
{align:justify|Below is a deep abyss wider than the sea because there is no border or shore. There are all kinds of pythons here, big, small... is baring its fangs and biting us. There were too many of these snakes to count, ferociously attacking me. Then I discovered: In this sea of blood there were many people but we couldn't see their heads, because everyone, like me, was quickly drowning in the sea of snakes. These snakes continuously bit and tore our bodies, causing our bones and muscles to weaken and our blood to flow endlessly. My body felt like it had been destroyed by bombs and bullets, feeling the ultimate pain, but in a moment, my flesh and body returned to their original state, then were bitten and tortured again, repeating that scene of suffering over and over again. Only then did I realize this was hell.}
{align:justify|karma shows mountains of knives and seas of fire, bronze pillars, oil pans, executions...}
{align:justify|I just want to soon get out of that foul, stinking sea of blood, when swarms of venomous snakes attack, I vaguely hear the sounds of many suffering people groaning, the sound is very faint. After experiencing enough misery, I finally left this place of torture and reached the shore. But climbing ashore is not the end of suffering in hell.}
{align:justify|Just coming out of the sea of snakes and crawling ashore, I was startled to see a "God", I can only call it "God", because he looked very tall, wore a dark gray robe, and had an extremely dignified appearance. Unlike the Gods in the world, he never opened his mouth to speak, only using the "spiritual communion" method of conversation, meaning that no language was poured out here (like communication by thought). so).}
{align:justify|Suddenly I understood: Because I don't have any religion, the person appearing before me doesn't have any religious appearance. Because I didn't believe in God or Buddha, was disobedient to my parents, lived a life of deceit and deceit, and acted as an immoral and immoral prostitute in a palace, I specialized in taking advantage of my beauty to deceive men to death... Because I committed all kinds of crimes, I came to this place to suffer.}
{align:justify|Mr. "God" advised me: After receiving the punishment, you must make an effort to practice.}
{align:justify|At that time, I didn't have the slightest sense of shame or repentance. I always felt that I was innocent and blameless. I was frustrated and angry, thinking: "Because you deceived me, I had to hang myself in anger, but when I died here, I was still bitten by poisonous snakes"... So I became furious... The God immediately disappeared.}
{align:justify|Mr. Than disappeared, I was chased by some yellow-skinned demons (like liver pain) and ran up a high mountain, the road was bumpy and unstable, causing me to trip and fall... Right when I fell, I realized there was a forest of sharp knives, all shapes and sizes: Short, long, big, small protruding from the ground, no matter where I went, as soon as I fell, these sharp knives automatically "attacked", like "spikes" or "sword traps" constantly "chopping" our bodies, causing the bones to fall, the flesh to crumble, the blood to flow continuously, and the pain made me faint. After that, my body returned to its original state and I continued to endure this torture, suffering without interruption.}
{align:justify|The crime scene is exactly as described in the Buddha's scriptures, no different. I only learned about it later when I studied Buddhism. Because in "Luong Hoang Sam" it was written:}
{align:justify|After a lifetime in hell, one is lucky to meet a good and knowledgeable person and listen to the Bodhisattva's rebuke and advice: "You must know how to repent and repent, vow to make amends to escape suffering."}
{align:justify|But because I was too aggressive, stubborn, and stubborn, I had to stay there and serve a long sentence.}
{align:justify|Even now when I think back, the feeling of those endless sufferings is still fresh, as if they had just reappeared on my body. Hell is exactly as the Buddha scriptures describe:}
{align:justify|From the upper floor, falling to the lower floor, being barked at by bronze dogs and chewing bones and swallowing marrow. Prisoner La Sat took a fork and stabbed it in the head... The sinner was burned all over by fire, and the iron net sent a rain of blades. The blade penetrates the body through the pores.}
{align:justify|When I got out of the mountain of knives, I was thrown into a terrible, indescribably large millstone! Looking at it moving loudly, I was very afraid of being crushed, but I couldn't find a place to hide, so I just kept running around on the surface of the mortar, but soon my body was crushed, causing immense pain... Then the body recovered completely, was crushed again, I heard the endless howling and moaning sounds of the sinners, they ran, stood, lay down, sat... chaos, everything was pureed.}
{align:justify|Escaped from the mill, I was tied to a red-hot bronze column, fire burned all around, my skin was burned, my consciousness was obscured.}
{align:justify|The body is burned and destroyed, then it returns to its original state. Next, I was tied to another large bronze pillar, and the devil used a sharp hook to pull out my tongue until it broke off and bled profusely. This was penance for the sins of foul mouthing, cursing, stabbing, and weaving lies.}
{align:justify|Then I was thrown into the oil pan, my body was like a fried pig, constantly rolling around, swelling, feeling like my body was being cut into pieces by a bomb, the pain was extremely painful, and my suffering was endless. But then my body recovered as before. As soon as I stuck my head out of the pan, the devil immediately used a fork to press it back into the oil pan, forcing me to continue being fried. Just like that, I'm half alive, half dead... This punishment keeps recurring, it's miserable beyond words. Because I created too much bad karma, when I worked in the kitchen, I used to fry, chop, grind... The animals are still alive, so this is just a taste of what we sowed.}
{align:justify|After getting out of the oil pan, the crowd and I went to a place where the land was dry. We had to shape the soil into round balls (big or small, shape and quantity were different). Once completed, we threw them into our gourds. This scene is like doing forced labor. Some people can't form the shape because the soil is too dry.}
{align:justify|Since going to hell, we haven't been able to eat or drink anything, so everyone is tired and hungry. After shaping the ground, we go to an area that looks like a fire zone, everyone hands over gourds and each person receives a bowl full of stinking white pus! Perhaps because my pre-natal conditions are still deeply imprinted, I find eating and drinking like this too strange, so I don't bother to use it!}
{align:justify|Reincarnation}
{align:justify|Afterwards, I was brought before a law enforcer (Judge), this man had thick eyebrows, big eyes, not a fierce look but very prestigious. Just like the God I met before the sea of snakes, he used the method of "spiritual communion" to tell me that I would be reincarnated into the world as a girl, he told me: “A thousand times, you should not create evil karma, you should not deceive people anymore, but you should do good deeds and accumulate virtue, practice a lot.”}
{align:justify|After hearing what he said, I was extremely dissatisfied and immediately complained to law enforcement! The excuse is that I have suffered too much, so I am not willing to be a woman anymore, I want to be a man to take revenge!}
{align:justify|Hearing what I said, the law enforcer looked very surprised. He didn't understand why I had endured enough torture without becoming confused and forgetting everything, but on the contrary still remembered the past very clearly? But he still asked me to line up, and gave each person a card with a number and color. I received a pink card. After everyone received the card, they went to line up in front of a gate according to the color of the card they held in their hands, waiting to be reincarnated.}
{align:justify|At that time, I heard some demons talking loudly:}
{align:justify|- Pink is reincarnated as a female, blue is reincarnated as a male, green is reincarnated as a duck, purple is reincarnated as…}
{align:justify|As soon as I heard that, I quickly sneaked over to the next line because I didn't want to be a woman, so while people weren't paying attention, I snatched the opponent's blue card and gave them my pink card.}
{align:justify|Seeing the devil rushing towards me, I quickly ran away, blending into the forest of people with green cards. Afraid that the devil would stop me, I immediately ran to an area with many houses. It was dark at that time, some houses here had lights on, some houses didn't. Based on the number written on the card, I found out the door number, immediately went in, and was reincarnated into the man I am today.}
{align:justify|The difference between the narrow alley and the narrow lane is compatible}
{align:justify|In this life, when I entered university, I met a girl who was the white-faced guy who tricked me in my previous life. The first time they met, the two sides felt very familiar, as if they had known each other for a long time. Gradually, the influence of the details of his life became more and more obvious. Finally, because my parents objected, and I also did not want to rekindle our predestined relationship, so we broke up (fortunately, I no longer wanted revenge).}
{align:justify|As for the couple from long ago, in this life they are my biological parents. The boy I deceived and killed, in this life became my wife. When we first met, I felt very familiar with her, but life was not compatible, because in my previous life I never loved her, so in this life I often felt disgusted with her for no reason or reason. That's why she always holds a grudge against me and treats my family members very coldly. The two sides often use the cold war to attack each other. Even though I made a lot of money for her and paid back the debt I had defrauded her in the past, she never seemed satisfied.}
{align:justify|In my previous life, there was a man who often helped me clear up many grievances, and is now my best friend.}
{align:justify|repentance of past crimes, warning the world to practice}
{align:justify|After studying Buddhism, I understand that everything is caused and effect. Looking back at myself, I realized that everything was caused by craving and attachment. In this life, the old habit has not been lost. But in this life, I will no longer be ignorant and create evil, will no longer compete for wealth, and will no longer use tricks to take over... If we keep following our bottomless desires, we will suffer forever.}
{align:justify|My first girlfriend and I broke up early and we all have our own marriages, but if we look honestly, it's still hard for me to forget her, deep down in my heart I realize I'm still in love with her. But I know this is just karma, an illusion and delusion, so I don't follow it.}
{align:justify|Because I hanged myself in my previous life, in this life I don't dare wear collared clothes, because I'm afraid of recreating the pain in my throat.}
{align:justify|Because I used to be a cook in my previous life, so in this life my cooking art is great.}
{align:justify|Because I have experienced the feeling of being fried in an oil pan, I am especially afraid of heat, not cold. In this life, whenever I see the mill moving, I immediately panic, my whole body gets goosebumps.}
{align:justify|In short, the habits and memories of previous lives are completely not lost.}
{align:justify|Looking back at the sufferings I have gone through, here are the rare teachings of the God and the Law Enforcement Officer that have helped open my mind. I clearly understand: As a person, you must be trustworthy, do not deceive, do not hurt others, and do not do anything against your conscience.}
{align:justify|I also know that life is mostly determined by karma, "do it yourself", we taste the fruit we grow. The person who harmed me did not intentionally want to harm me, I suffered because I had to pay back according to the law of cause and effect. Therefore, towards others, I should be tolerant and tolerant and not give rise to anger.}
{align:justify|Having tasted and understood the suffering of hell, do you think I will indulge in the five desires and bury my head in creating evil anymore?}
{align:justify|Even though in my previous life I was a very evil and irreligious person, in this life I learned to seek out Buddhism and follow the teachings of the Buddhas because the hell scene described in the scriptures was exactly the same as what I had encountered.}
{align:justify|I only want to practice now, practice diligently to achieve liberation and have no desire for anything in this world. I really want to return to Amitabha Buddha's Pure Land, practice to attain enlightenment, and then return to save the suffering sentient beings here.}
{align:justify|Through this experience, I sincerely repent of all the mistakes I have made in the past, pray to the Buddhas and Bodhisattvas for blessings, so that I can eliminate karma, grow good roots, be reborn in the Pure Land, and escape reincarnation.}
{align:justify|“Actually, all of us have gone to hell, because our hearts are full of evil thoughts. But because I'm so confused, I can't remember. Some people are even permanent guests of hell, this is called "just escaping and then coming back in". Hell is inherently empty, it is created by evil karma.}
